@context Two efforts overlap.

! conclusion: Read both, say where they connect and where they do not, then merge what fits.

  + IF:
    The operator says we may be at a point where they could merge.

  + HOWEVER:
    Merging early can bury the smaller effort.

  + THEN:
    Read both, say where they connect and where they do not, then merge what fits.

  + BECAUSE:
    The merge should rest on the real documents.
